%% Logical view; deployment TBD. 13 runtime nodes and 13 directed communication edges (E1–E13).
%% One unconnected text annotation provides the visible footnote and legend; it is not a runtime component.
%% Canonical SRS: ../../../FEAT-029-master-srs/artifacts/Sketch2Life_Master_SRS.md ; B2/B3/B8/B15/B17 OD16; BR14; FR040; UC-023.
